674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nflaWMVuhRoQ7kNvwHmw7Z_&_nc_oc=AdroCz7zHDVJM1J3NZpOrceMVDjik0LWpopcq0Nk2ozWfFCcYzCFY2mbyyOzQAZWJiA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKh2hKMQ_Pmy5zi_3C_xPkHmAr3yvZg0zE3HRALGykQWg&oe=6AB928D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SpBSEtA-SMEQ7kNvwG-IjWS&_nc_oc=Adq1obcOemt4Q-cHFCWa1CTVH7Ypv0i-Y6WjBX63SqMrFHVvYknYC2WxaP_DUuip8Ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKL9DRs2fVKrx8ppIN_PK8jax4-i0lABI72LAWTgUXtHA&oe=6AB93196"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bs7M1WNmiCkQ7kNvwGsX07K&_nc_oc=AdpP24mKpa2SQJjvBULwq8DoH5I8UlHqfk8WNOnOhyp1LwPsHlbUVzBIwTe_bqZPgV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKTx62oY-Cyoz4lbhn4BHOZ9pMF6iHsFLyP5rI0bGf8PA&oe=6AB92DB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip